# U48 a: import Sub/allflame_exp_030 as the comparison build (U46's folder popup), pick the
# first metric (Full DPS: useFullDPS, the FullDPS fallback of GetFromOutput) with every category
# on: RunComparePowerReport creates and runs the ComparePowerBuilder coroutine (tree nodes,
# items, jewels, socket groups, support gems, config options), the list syncs (SetReport,
# ReList, ReSort(3)). Select the first row (the list takes the focus, so its tooltips show) and
# hover two more (socket groups / config rows: AddValueTooltip clears the tooltip), sort by
# Category (ReSort 1) and hover an item row (the item tooltip), by Points (ReSort 4: the tree
# rows first) and hover two tree rows (the node tooltip), then by Per Point and impact (ReSort
# 5, 3).
#! u48-expect-text u48 SUMMARY progress=100
#! u48-expect-text ^7stub UNIQUE
#! u48-expect-text ^7stub Normal
screen 1280 800 dpi 1
fixture userdir=user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
move 116 122
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 718 48
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 640 460
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 640 236
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
